  "shownotes_html": "<p><span>5月10日、11日，我在上海参加第三届“</span><a href=\"https://www.xiaoyuzhoufm.com/podcast/653c74e3ef940c8f71e8ca5f?s=eyJ1IjogIjYxZjQyMGM4MmNiZDdjMDE3NjYyZjNmZSJ9\" data-url=\"https://www.xiaoyuzhoufm.com/podcast/653c74e3ef940c8f71e8ca5f?s=eyJ1IjogIjYxZjQyMGM4MmNiZDdjMDE3NjYyZjNmZSJ9\"><span>狂喜播客节</span></a><span>”，这次以“观察员”的身份在现场四处乱窜，采访了许多志愿者、听众（观众）、主播、赞助商，问了问大家对这次播客节的感受。同时作为主播志愿者，我也参与了一场对谈的录制，现场录音稍后可能也会发布出来。</span></p><figure><img src=\"https://image.xyzcdn.net/Fi9YHFqfo0aWYAW3L1yP9hoDGKxw.jpg\"></figure><p><span>两天时间，我都处在兴奋和愉悦之中，“播客”本就是我的爱，到现场和同好们一起看自己喜欢的主播录播客，甚至自己亲自录播客，让这种爱的喜悦放大了无数倍。希望你也能分享这些快乐。</span></p><figure><img src=\"https://image.xyzcdn.net/FrfGxMSi1fvAr6xObMBnBOlDGowB.jpg\"></figure><p><span>————————————————————</span></p><p><strong><span>主播：</span></strong><span>羊行</span></p><p><strong><span>录制日期：</span></strong><span>2025年5月10日</span></p><p><strong><span>发布日期：</span></strong><span>2025年5月18日</span></p><p><span>————————————————————</span></p><p><strong><span>本期采访到的朋友们：</span></strong></p><p><span><a class=\"timestamp\" data-timestamp=\"129\">2:09</a> 关注AI话题的听众</span></p><p><span><a class=\"timestamp\" data-timestamp=\"199\">3:19</a> 从重庆来来的听众</span></p><p><span><a class=\"timestamp\" data-timestamp=\"290\">4:50</a> 斯斯 &nbsp;&nbsp;</span><a href=\"https://www.xiaoyuzhoufm.com/podcast/604f3cd042d469df009c3e0d?s=eyJ1IjogIjYxZjQyMGM4MmNiZDdjMDE3NjYyZjNmZSJ9\" data-url=\"https://www.xiaoyuzhoufm.com/podcast/604f3cd042d469df009c3e0d?s=eyJ1IjogIjYxZjQyMGM4MmNiZDdjMDE3NjYyZjNmZSJ9\"><span>闪光少女</span></a><span> / 给女孩的商业第一课 主播</span></p><p><span><a class=\"timestamp\" data-timestamp=\"370\">6:10</a> 老袁 「狂喜播客节」0号主播志愿者 /「</span><a href=\"https://www.xiaoyuzhoufm.com/podcast/5ead7b4c418a84a046abaee6?s=eyJ1IjogIjYxZjQyMGM4MmNiZDdjMDE3NjYyZjNmZSJ9\" data-url=\"https://www.xiaoyuzhoufm.com/podcast/5ead7b4c418a84a046abaee6?s=eyJ1IjogIjYxZjQyMGM4MmNiZDdjMDE3NjYyZjNmZSJ9\"><span>播客公社</span></a><span>」发起人 / 《播客志》主编</span></p><p><span><a class=\"timestamp\" data-timestamp=\"550\">9:10</a> 路荣 「</span><a href=\"https://www.xiaoyuzhoufm.com/podcast/62b337cf67c02bf50f58a20a?s=eyJ1IjogIjYxZjQyMGM4MmNiZDdjMDE3NjYyZjNmZSJ9\" data-url=\"https://www.xiaoyuzhoufm.com/podcast/62b337cf67c02bf50f58a20a?s=eyJ1IjogIjYxZjQyMGM4MmNiZDdjMDE3NjYyZjNmZSJ9\"><span>视角片兼</span></a><span>」主播 7号厅志愿者</span></p><p><span><a class=\"timestamp\" data-timestamp=\"702\">11:42</a> 罗宇晨 「</span><a href=\"https://mp.weixin.qq.com/s/0HDR21FW0tvPuIg5WMOWQg\" data-url=\"https://mp.weixin.qq.com/s/0HDR21FW0tvPuIg5WMOWQg\"><span>田园酿造</span></a><span>」创始人 葡萄酒酿酒师</span></p><p><span><a class=\"timestamp\" data-timestamp=\"951\">15:51</a> 刘泡泡 「</span><a href=\"https://www.xiaoyuzhoufm.com/podcast/658fb121c0d4d5dc8ccad771?s=eyJ1IjogIjYxZjQyMGM4MmNiZDdjMDE3NjYyZjNmZSJ9\" data-url=\"https://www.xiaoyuzhoufm.com/podcast/658fb121c0d4d5dc8ccad771?s=eyJ1IjogIjYxZjQyMGM4MmNiZDdjMDE3NjYyZjNmZSJ9\"><span>抽象撒野</span></a><span>」主播 志愿者</span></p><p><span><a class=\"timestamp\" data-timestamp=\"1104\">18:24</a> 树杨 &nbsp;「</span><a href=\"https://www.xiaoyuzhoufm.com/podcast/62a44d14273a9f1de2a38c24?s=eyJ1IjogIjYxZjQyMGM4MmNiZDdjMDE3NjYyZjNmZSJ9\" data-url=\"https://www.xiaoyuzhoufm.com/podcast/62a44d14273a9f1de2a38c24?s=eyJ1IjogIjYxZjQyMGM4MmNiZDdjMDE3NjYyZjNmZSJ9\"><span>中国好生意</span></a><span>」主播</span></p><p><span><a class=\"timestamp\" data-timestamp=\"1287\">21:27</a> 糖医生lesley &nbsp;「</span><a href=\"https://www.xiaoyuzhoufm.com/podcast/62c9a91f395e8fd774bab0e9?s=eyJ1IjogIjYxZjQyMGM4MmNiZDdjMDE3NjYyZjNmZSJ9\" data-url=\"https://www.xiaoyuzhoufm.com/podcast/62c9a91f395e8fd774bab0e9?s=eyJ1IjogIjYxZjQyMGM4MmNiZDdjMDE3NjYyZjNmZSJ9\"><span>去病三分糖</span></a><span>」主播 志愿者</span></p><p><span><a class=\"timestamp\" data-timestamp=\"1753\">29:13</a> 东东枪 </span><a href=\"https://www.xiaoyuzhoufm.com/podcast/5e280fa7418a84a0461f912b?s=eyJ1IjogIjYxZjQyMGM4MmNiZDdjMDE3NjYyZjNmZSJ9\" data-url=\"https://www.xiaoyuzhoufm.com/podcast/5e280fa7418a84a0461f912b?s=eyJ1IjogIjYxZjQyMGM4MmNiZDdjMDE3Nj